{"output":"I’ll inspect authorization and project-list caching, patch the isolation gaps, and run the existing tests without changing them or installing dependencies.\n\nProject reads omit the ownership membership check, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates invalidate only a detail key. The existing eight tests pass but do not cover these bugs. I’ll fix those three paths and add regression tests for authorization, cache variants, and targeted invalidation.\n\nFixed ownership membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected organization variants without evicting others. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","final_output":"Fixed ownership membership checks for project reads and updates. List caching now isolates organizations, preserves pagination and sorting, and invalidates all affected organization variants without evicting others. Cache-hit authorization remains enforced.\n\nAdded three regression tests; existing tests unchanged. No dependencies installed.\n\nVerification: npm test passed all 11 tests; git diff --check passed. Exit code 0.","exit_code":0,"model":"gpt-6-astra","session_id":"","steps":27,"tool_calls":[{"name":"skill","status":"success"},{"name":"shell","status":"success","command_result":{"kind":"command","command":"pwd; git status --short; ls -a","cwd":"/private/tmp/handwork-batching-iincv9nu/tenant-cache-1-baseline/repo","exit_code":0,"signal":null,"timed_out":false,"duration_ms":385,"stdout_bytes":133,"stderr_bytes":42,"truncated":false,"output_file":"handwork-command-replay-2a4cc7c73062f846a44fc07a4562a31b.bin","stdout_file":null,"stderr_file":null}},{"name":"glob_files","status":"success"},{"name":"read_file","status":"success"},{"name":"glob_files","stat